INSERT INTO cases VALUES ('blueberry', 'rust', 'Blueberry', 'Leaf rust', 'Fungal', 'A highbush blueberry leaf with leaf rust in late summer after a run of long, wet nights.', 'Managed', 'orchard', 'leafspecimen.blueberry.rust', 1.0, 'Leaf rust (Thekopsora / Pucciniastrum) needs an alternate conifer host (hemlock) and about two days of leaf wetness to infect. Yellow spots above and orange spore pustules below lead to early leaf drop.', 'Disease managed: rusted tissue removed, foliage kept drier and healthy leaves protected. Existing spots remain.', 2);
